Package: inrep
Type: Package
Title: Instant Reports for Adaptive Assessments
Version: 0.3.4
Date: 2026-05-11
Author: Clievins Selva [aut, cre] (<https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9980-7127>)
Authors@R: person(given = "Clievins", family = "Selva", email = "selva@uni-hildesheim.de", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9980-7127"))
Maintainer: Clievins Selva <selva@uni-hildesheim.de>
Description: Administers fixed-form and adaptive questionnaires in a web
    interface built with 'shiny'. In adaptive mode, items are selected by
    Fisher information and ability is estimated by expected a posteriori
    (EAP) estimation on a grid, using item parameters calibrated elsewhere
    (1PL, 2PL, 3PL or graded response model); the package does not estimate
    item parameters. Also provides item bank checks, configurable page flows,
    participant reports and data export (RDS, CSV, JSON, PDF).
URL: https://github.com/selvastics/inrep
BugReports: https://github.com/selvastics/inrep/issues
